	(text "Debug UART (1.5 Mb/s), RESET and RECOVERY buttons, status LEDs, the SDI add-on header (not fitted)\nand mounting holes.  The SDI header carries the module's 16-bit DVP camera input (BT.1120 from an SDI\nreceiver such as the GS2971A).  On the CM3 the DVP pins are free: its Ethernet uses GMAC1_M0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
